{"id":"n14821-2-6","stage":4,"title":"동행 · 同路人","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14821-2-6-1","ko":"여기가 빈자리면 앉아도 될까요?","zh":"这里如果没人，我能坐吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빈자리면","meaning":"空；座位，席位","explanation":"비다：空；자리：座位，席位；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"비다","audio":"/audio/5d9a2faad9573f211726.mp3"},{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15680","senseId":"1","lemma":"비다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉아도","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까요?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"5d9a2faad9573f21","term":"비다","zh":"空","audio":"/audio/5d9a2faad9573f211726.mp3","entryId":"15680","definition":"某个空间里没有任何人或任何事物。","pronunciation":["비ː다"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a8fcf9fde65c26e28af.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14821-2-6-2","ko":"죄송하지만 제가 동행이 있어서요.","zh":"抱歉，我还有同行的人要坐。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동행이","meaning":"同路人，同行者","explanation":"동행：同路人，同行者；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동행","audio":"/audio/94dbdc6106f115ca0d7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14821","senseId":"2","lemma":"동행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어서요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"94dbdc6106f115ca","term":"동행","zh":"同路人，同行者","audio":"/audio/94dbdc6106f115ca0d7b.mp3","entryId":"14821","definition":"一起去的人。","pronunciation":["동행"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있